{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43613","headline":"寒夜联句 · 陆龟蒙","name":"寒夜联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静境揖神凝，寒华射林缺。\n清知思绪断，爽觉心源彻。\n高唱戛金奏，朗咏铿玉节。\n我思方泬寥，君词复凄切。\n况闻风篁上，摆落残冻雪。\n寂尔万籁清，皎然诸霭灭。\n西窗客无梦，南浦波应结。\n河光正如劒，月魄方似玦。\n短烬不禁挑，冷毫看欲折。\n何夕重相期，浊醪还爲设。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}